{"source": "side_03.mp4", "segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 2.32, "text": "You make a plan when you're feeling motivated.", "words": [{"s": 0.0, "e": 0.24, "w": " You", "p": 0.95}, {"s": 0.24, "e": 0.44, "w": " make", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 0.44, "e": 0.74, "w": " a", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 0.74, "e": 1.0, "w": " plan", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 1.0, "e": 1.18, "w": " when", "p": 0.99}, {"s": 1.18, "e": 1.38, "w": " you're", "p": 0.98}, {"s": 1.38, "e": 1.62, "w": " feeling", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 1.62, "e": 2.32, "w": " motivated.", "p": 1.0}]}, {"start": 2.88, "end": 5.84, "text": "Wake up early, work out, get everything done.", "words": [{"s": 2.88, "e": 2.98, "w": " Wake", "p": 0.99}, {"s": 2.98, "e": 3.2, "w": " up", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 3.2, "e": 3.58, "w": " early,", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 3.92, "e": 4.1, "w": " work", "p": 0.59}, {"s": 4.1, "e": 4.44, "w": " out,", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 4.74, "e": 5.0, "w": " get", "p": 0.99}, {"s": 5.0, "e": 5.5, "w": " everything", "p": 0.99}, {"s": 5.5, "e": 5.84, "w": " done.", "p": 1.0}]}, {"start": 6.32, "end": 7.78, "text": "Then you have a busy day.", "words": [{"s": 6.32, "e": 6.62, "w": " Then", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 6.62, "e": 6.9, "w": " you", "p": 0.74}, {"s": 6.9, "e": 7.02, "w": " have", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 7.02, "e": 7.22, "w": " a", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 7.22, "e": 7.44, "w": " busy", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 7.44, "e": 7.78, "w": " day.", "p": 1.0}]}, {"start": 8.18, "end": 9.22, "text": "You get home tired.", "words": [{"s": 8.18, "e": 8.32, "w": " You", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 8.32, "e": 8.48, "w": " get", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 8.48, "e": 8.72, "w": " home", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 8.72, "e": 9.22, "w": " tired.", "p": 0.99}]}, {"start": 9.68, "end": 10.94, "text": "Half the plan doesn't happen.", "words": [{"s": 9.68, "e": 9.86, "w": " Half", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 9.86, "e": 10.08, "w": " the", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 10.08, "e": 10.24, "w": " plan", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 10.24, "e": 10.62, "w": " doesn't", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 10.62, "e": 10.94, "w": " happen.", "p": 1.0}]}, {"start": 11.28, "end": 12.98, "text": "And you decide you're just lazy.", "words": [{"s": 11.28, "e": 11.44, "w": " And", "p": 0.97}, {"s": 11.44, "e": 11.62, "w": " you", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 11.62, "e": 11.94, "w": " decide", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 11.94, "e": 12.26, "w": " you're", "p": 0.92}, {"s": 12.26, "e": 12.54, "w": " just", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 12.54, "e": 12.98, "w": " lazy.", "p": 1.0}]}, {"start": 13.48, "end": 15.74, "text": "But did you leave any room for being tired?", "words": [{"s": 13.48, "e": 13.62, "w": " But", "p": 0.99}, {"s": 13.62, "e": 13.78, "w": " did", "p": 0.98}, {"s": 13.78, "e": 14.02, "w": " you", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 14.02, "e": 14.2, "w": " leave", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 14.2, "e": 14.56, "w": " any", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 14.56, "e": 14.88, "w": " room", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 14.88, "e": 15.12, "w": " for", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 15.12, "e": 15.36, "w": " being", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 15.36, "e": 15.74, "w": " tired?", "p": 1.0}]}, {"start": 16.36, "end": 18.32, "text": "Plan what you can do on a normal day.", "words": [{"s": 16.36, "e": 16.58, "w": " Plan", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 16.58, "e": 16.76, "w": " what", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 16.76, "e": 16.92, "w": " you", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 16.92, "e": 17.1, "w": " can", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 17.1, "e": 17.3, "w": " do", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 17.3, "e": 17.52, "w": " on", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 17.52, "e": 17.76, "w": " a", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 17.76, "e": 18.02, "w": " normal", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 18.02, "e": 18.32, "w": " day.", "p": 1.0}]}, {"start": 18.64, "end": 20.82, "text": "You can always do more when you have the energy.", "words": [{"s": 18.64, "e": 18.78, "w": " You", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 18.78, "e": 19.02, "w": " can", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 19.02, "e": 19.42, "w": " always", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 19.42, "e": 19.64, "w": " do", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 19.64, "e": 19.92, "w": " more", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 19.92, "e": 20.08, "w": " when", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 20.08, "e": 20.24, "w": " you", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 20.24, "e": 20.32, "w": " have", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 20.32, "e": 20.58, "w": " the", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 20.5